      "desc": "You've entered a kitchen.\n\n You see [if c_0 is locked]a locked[else if c_0 is open]an opened[otherwise]a closed[end if] fridge in the room.[if c_0 is open and there is something in the c_0] The fridge contains [a list of things in the c_0].[end if][if c_0 is open and the c_0 contains nothing] The fridge is empty.[end if] You see an oven.[if oven_0 is open and there is something in the oven_0] The oven contains [a list of things in the oven_0].[end if][if oven_0 is open and the oven_0 contains nothing] The oven is empty.[end if] You see a table. [if there is something on the s_0]On the table you can see [a list of things on the s_0].[end if][if there is nothing on the s_0]But there is nothing on it.[end if] You can see a counter. [if there is something on the s_1]On the counter you see [a list of things on the s_1].[end if][if there is nothing on the s_1]But there is nothing on it.[end if] You can see a stove. [if there is something on the stove_0]On the stove you can see [a list of things on the stove_0].[end if][if there is nothing on the stove_0]But there is nothing on it.[end if]\n\n There is [if d_0 is open]an open[otherwise]a closed[end if] frosted-glass door leading west. There is an exit to the east. Don't worry, there is no door. There is an exit to the north.",
